_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\nWhen creating a story for a component that sets empty functions as defaults for (some) event handling props, the default functions get passed in through args, even though the argType for the prop is set to `{ action: 'actionName'}`.\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n\r\n1. Create a component that accepts a function as a prop.\r\n2. Give the prop a function as default value (e.g. `() => {}`)\r\n3. Create a story, which sets the argType for the prop to `{action: 'actionName'}`\r\n4. Trigger the function in storybook.\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nA log of the action 'actionName' in the Actions tab.\r\n\r\n**Code snippets**\r\nTestStory.js:\r\n```js\r\nimport React from 'react';\r\n\r\nconst TestStory = ({ onClick = () => { console.log('test') } }) => <button onClick={onClick}>Click me!</button>;\r\n\r\nexport default TestStory;\r\n```\r\n\r\nTestStory.stories.js:\r\n```js\r\nimport React from 'react';\r\nimport TestStory from './TestStory';\r\n\r\nexport default {\r\n  title: 'core/Test case',\r\n  component: TestStory,\r\n  args: {},\r\n  argTypes: {\r\n    onClick: { action: 'onClick', control: null }\r\n  }\r\n};\r\n\r\nexport const Default = args => {\r\n  console.log(args.onClick);\r\n  return <TestStory {...args} />;\r\n};\r\n```\r\n\r\n**System:**\r\nEnvironment Info:\r\n\r\n  System:\r\n    OS: macOS 10.15.6\r\n    CPU: (16) x64 Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-9980HK CPU @ 2.40GHz\r\n  Binaries:\r\n    Node: 12.13.1 - ~/.nvm/versions/node/v12.13.1/bin/node\r\n    Yarn: 1.22.4 - /usr/local/bin/yarn\r\n    npm: 6.14.7 - ~/.nvm/versions/node/v12.13.1/bin/npm\r\n  Browsers:\r\n    Chrome: 84.0.4147.135\r\n    Safari: 13.1.2\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\nIf the component is in the same file as the story, the problem doesn't occur. If storybook is unable to fetch info about the components properties the issue also doesn't occur: when storybook is unable to prefill the ArgTable in the Controls tab.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"shilman","id":488689,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODY4OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/488689?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman","html_url":"https://github.com/shilman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shilman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/12120/reactions","total_count":11,"+1":11,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/storybookjs/storybook/issues/12120/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}